  "caption": {
    "text": "Part 2 of CORS FIELD NOTES. 'Failed to fetch' is almost never a fetch problem. This 10-part field guide walks the whole CORS handshake — origin triples, the simple-request safelist, the OPTIONS probe, the credentials wildcard ban, Vary and cache poisoning, and the reflection bug that hands your authenticated JSON to any site on the internet. Save it for the next time a preflight returns 401 and the console blames CORS.",
